        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In bladder cancer, we are not currently aware of a direct competitor offering genomic testing for prognostic purposes that match the intended use population for our test.",
        "start_character": 29101,
        "end_character": 29271
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001384101-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001384101-26-000010-9ec6a0969789a71a",
        "accession_number": "0001384101-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Pursuant to the agreement, we pay TCP a monthly fee on a per FNA basis, and TCP manages and supervises the pathologists who perform the cytopathology services as a component of the Afirma solution.",
        "start_character": 75038,
        "end_character": 75235
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001384101-26-000010",
