        "accession_number": "0001384101-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The FCPA prohibits any United States individual, business entity or employee of a United States business entity to offer or provide, directly or through a third party, including any potential distributors we may rely on in certain markets, anything of value to a foreign government official with corrupt intent to influence an award or continuation of business or to gain an unfair advantage, whether or not such conduct violates local laws.",
        "start_character": 91189,
        "end_character": 91630
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001384101-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001384101-26-000010-9ec6a0969789a71a",
        "accession_number": "0001384101-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In order to remain competitive, we must develop and maintain protection of the proprietary aspects of our technologies.",
        "start_character": 30995,
        "end_character": 31114
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001384101-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001384101-26-000010-9ec6a0969789a71a",
        "accession_number": "0001384101-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In the United States, we offer laboratory developed tests, or LDTs, through our centralized Clinical Laboratory Improvement Amendments of 1988, or CLIA, certified laboratories in South San Francisco and San Diego, California, supported by our cytopathology expertise in Austin, Texas.",
        "start_character": 940,
        "end_character": 1224
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001384101-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001384101-26-000010-9ec6a0969789a71a",
        "accession_number": "0001384101-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Once we have developed robust clinical evidence and physician adoption of our tests in the United States, we aim to drive further patient access by launching them, as appropriate, into global markets as IVD tests.",
        "start_character": 18235,
        "end_character": 18448
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001384101-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001384101-26-000010-9ec6a0969789a71a",
        "accession_number": "0001384101-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are also currently developing our Decipher Prostate test as a quantitative polymerase chain reaction-based, or qPCR-based, test to be launched as a decentralized IVD test outside of the United States.",
        "start_character": 19270,
        "end_character": 19473
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001384101-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001384101-26-000010-9ec6a0969789a71a",
        "accession_number": "0001384101-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are also required to comply with the administrative simplification standards under HIPAA when we conduct the electronic transactions regulated by HIPAA, including by using standard code sets and formats and standardized identifiers for health plans and providers.",
        "start_character": 66554,
        "end_character": 66820
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001384101-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001384101-26-000010-9ec6a0969789a71a",
        "accession_number": "0001384101-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are subject to the federal physician self-referral prohibitions, commonly known as the Stark Law, and to similar restrictions under the self-referral prohibitions of certain states in which we operate, including California's Physician Ownership and Referral Act, or PORA.",
        "start_character": 75291,
        "end_character": 75565
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001384101-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001384101-26-000010-9ec6a0969789a71a",
        "accession_number": "0001384101-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe that our Decipher Prostate test, Afirma classifier and Decipher Bladder test, have been developed and are performed in a manner consistent with the FDA’s enforcement discretion policy.",
